00:57:26.010 --> 00:57:39.580
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our program by our boss Mr. Torey Malatia, who follows me around the office trying to always get me to say the letter L, which he knows I can't say. He especially loves it when I say Lillian Hellman.
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ电台对我们节目的管理监督由我们的老板托里·马拉蒂亚（Torey Malatia）先生负责，他一直在办公室里跟着我，试图让我说出字母L，他知道我发不出那个音。他尤其喜欢我说“莉莲·海尔曼”（Lillian Hellman）的时候。

00:57:39.580 --> 00:57:45.380
<v David Rakoff>Go on, say it. Say it. Say it.
<v David Rakoff>说出来。快，说出来。说出来。

00:57:45.380 --> 00:57:56.790
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

